### REST Client Test - Module Manage Infrastruktur Tipe

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@authToken = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. GET ALL Infrastruktur Tipe
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/manage/infrastruktur-tipe
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. GET BY ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/manage/infrastruktur-tipe/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. CREATE Tipe Infrastruktur
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/manage/infrastruktur-tipe
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kode": "drainase",
  "nama": "Drainase Perkotaan",
  "deskripsi": "Saluran pembuangan air hujan dan limbah rumah tangga",
  "ikon": "droplets",
  "warna": "#06B6D4",
  "geom_type": "LINESTRING",
  "table_name": "drainase",
  "has_segmen": true,
  "is_active": true,
  "sort_order": 3
}

###

### 4. UPDATE Tipe Infrastruktur
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/manage/infrastruktur-tipe/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Drainase & Saluran Air",
  "warna": "#0891B2",
  "sort_order": 3
}

###

### 5. DELETE Tipe Infrastruktur
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/manage/infrastruktur-tipe/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
